 "remarks": "Welcome to 94 Field Crest Road, where turnkey living meets an exceptional resort-style lifestyle. Tucked away on a quiet New Canaan cul-de-sac just minutes from town, top-rated schools, Waveny Park and the YMCA, this beautifully renovated home offers the rare combination of privacy, convenience and effortless luxury. Fresh, sophisticated interiors are completely move-in ready. Complete w beautifully updated kitchen and bathrooms and thoughtfully designed living spaces, ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. The spacious primary suite features a large walk-in closet and en-suite bath, while the three additional bedrooms offer fabulous natural light and generous space. The lower level and basement provide valuable bonus space with endless possibilities for a media room, home office, gym, playroom, guest or in-law space. Outside is where this property truly sets itself apart. The private backyard has been transformed into a spectacular resort-style retreat featuring a Gunite pool and spa with waterfall, an expansive putting lawn with pitching spots throughout the yard, a built-in bocce court, and a stunning custom stone outdoor kitchen and bar with tv, creating the ultimate space for poolside dining and entertaining. Whether hosting summer gatherings, relaxing poolside, practicing your short game or enjoying an evening with friends, every element has been designed to make home feel like a getaway.",
